'''Kibabi''' ([[IPA]]: /kiːbɑːbiː/; [[Kibabian language|Kibabian]]: TBD) is a [[wikipedia:sovereign state|sovereign state]] in the continent of [[Daroch]] on the planet [[Basis]]. It is bordered by [[COUNTRY]] to the north, [[COUNTRY]] to the east, [[COUNTRY]] to the south, and [[COUNTRY]] to the west. 

Kibabi is among the five poorest countries on Basis, with the [[List of countries on Basis by GDP (PPP) per capita|lowest GDP per capita at purchasing power parity (PPP) on the planet]] as of {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. As of that same year, according to the [[wikipedia:Humdan Development Index|Human Development Index]], the country had the [[List of countries on Basis by Human Development Index|lowest level of human development]], with a score of 0.406. It has maintained an informal economy mainly based on a [[wikipedia:narco-state|narco-economy]] and remittances from [[Kibabian people|Kibabians]] working abroad. 

